  "narrative": {
    "key_bets": [
      "Quantum Magnetic Field (QMF) effect suppresses bremsstrahlung sufficiently to enable p-B11 net energy despite Z=5 radiation losses",
      "Fusion yield improves 120,000× from current 0.25 J/shot (D) to 30 kJ/shot (p-B11) via compression, I⁴ capacitor scaling, and fuel switch",
      "Ion beam decelerator achieves ~85% efficiency on a divergent, multi-species, ~10 ns DPF ion beam (vs. mono-energetic accelerator context)",
      "X-ray photoelectric converter ('never-before-built multilayered vacuum tube') achieves 80%+ efficiency at DPF plasma X-ray energies",
      "200 Hz rep-rate sustained at 2.7 MA with monthly beryllium electrode replacement and 10 kW/cm² anode thermal limit",
      "Filament disruption problem at high current is resolvable, enabling plasmoid stability to support predicted yield scaling",
      "Q_sci reaches at least 2.5 so recirculating fraction drops to ~57% for commercially viable specific capital"
    ],
    "eliminated_costs": [
      "CAS22.01 First Wall / Blanket — zero (aneutronic p-B11 produces no 14 MeV neutrons, no breeding blanket required)",
      "CAS22.03 External Coils — zero (self-pinch confinement, no superconducting or copper magnets)",
      "CAS22.04 Supplementary Heating — zero (no NBI, ECRH, or ICRH; driver energy couples directly via pinch)",
      "CAS23 Turbine Plant — zero (direct energy conversion replaces thermal cycle entirely)",
      "CAS27 Special Materials / tritium supply chain — zero (no tritium breeding, no FLiBe/LiPb, no Li-6 enrichment, no REBCO)"
    ],
    "novel_costs": [
      "CAS22.09 Direct Energy Converter — dual-path ion beam decelerator + X-ray photoelectric vacuum tube ($200M FOAK, no library analogue)",
      "CAS22.07 Capacitor bank pulsed-power driver with 10%/yr replacement cadence at 200 Hz commercial duty",
      "Monthly beryllium electrode replacement (200 modules × 12/yr) with specialty handling for toxic Be machining",
      "Isotopically enriched decaborane fuel handling (B-10 < 0.07%) with single-source Russian purification + Czech synthesis supply chain",
      "C-11 radioactive exhaust management at 200 Hz rep-rate (20-min half-life side reaction, no precedent at commercial scale)"
    ],
    "risks": [
      {
        "description": "QMF bremsstrahlung suppression effect is TRL 1 — theoretical only, never experimentally confirmed; if absent, p-B11 net energy is impossible under classical physics",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "22-year yield plateau at 0.25 J/shot with no progress past the 2001 Speed-2 record; 120,000× improvement required to reach 30 kJ/shot target",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "Neither direct energy conversion device (ion beam decelerator, X-ray photoelectric converter) has a prototype, engineering design, or component test; no thermal fallback exists",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "p-B11 fusion yield has never been measured in any DPF; 2024 Frontiers paper describes preparations, not results",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "Extremely high recirculating fraction (82% at Q=1.72 FOAK) drives high specific $/kWe and leaves no margin for engineering losses near breakeven",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "200 Hz rep-rate at 2.7 MA fusion-relevant conditions never demonstrated; best analogue is 16 Hz NX2 at far lower currents for non-fusion X-ray applications",
        "severity": "high"
      },
      {
        "description": "Electrode erosion rate at 2.7 MA × 200 Hz is completely uncharacterized; monthly beryllium replacement cadence is design intent only",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      {
        "description": "Isotopic boron-11 enrichment supply chain is single-sourced in Russia (purification) and Czech Republic (decaborane synthesis) — geopolitical concentration risk",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      {
        "description": "No independent verification by any national lab or university of LPPFusion's >200 keV ion temperature or record plasma purity claims",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      {
        "description": "Filament disruption at high current causes 'low densities and lower-than-predicted yields' and is the identified current experimental blocker",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      {
        "description": "No plant-level cost study, no fixed/variable O&M breakdown, no BOP design for DEC-based plant exists in any source",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      {
        "description": "Commercial-scale enriched decaborane price ('many hundred-fold' reduction from $600/gram) has no production pathway analysis",
        "severity": "low"
      },
      {
        "description": "C-11 (20-min half-life) exhaust management at 200 Hz commercial scale is uncharacterized",
        "severity": "low"
      },
      {
        "description": "Diamond-film UV-laser switches proposed for decelerator backflow prevention are research-stage and not commercially available",
        "severity": "low"
      }
    ]
  },
